app is a page
    title is "Styling"
    background is "linear-gradient(#000, #123)"
.
hero is a image
    source is "assets/hero.png"
    alt is "Hero"
.
docs is a link
    url is "https://example.com"
    text is "Docs"
.
panel is a text
    text is "<b>not bold</b>"
    customstyle is "transform: rotate(5deg); filter: blur(1px)"
.
put hero, docs, panel in app
show app
